OL,3,GNEWSAFight to save station ticket
OL,4,Aoffice after 30 years
OL,5,
OL,6,FCampaigners fear passengers who need
OL,7,Fextra help could be left behind if a
OL,8,Frailway station's ticket office closes
OL,9,Fafter 30 years.
OL,11,FThe office at Gobowen station in
OL,12,FShropshire is due to shut at the end of
OL,13,Fthe year after not-for-profit company
OL,14,FSevern Dee Travel said it was no longer
OL,15,Ffinancially viable.
OL,17,FThe facility also houses a cafe used by
OL,18,Fstudents from Derwen College for work
OL,19,Fexperience, adding to concerns about
OL,20,Fits future.
OL,23,APub: 20-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,358,350,200,160,0,100
