OL,3,GNEWSAFight to save station ticket
OL,4,Aoffice after 30 years
OL,5,
OL,6,FMore than 2,000 people have signed a
OL,7,Fpetition calling for the ticket office
OL,8,Fto remain open, arguing some passengers
OL,9,Fstill need face-to-face support when
OL,10,Fplanning journeys and buying tickets.
